 activity is not critical (PubMed:25342469). May act as a scaffold molecule to regulate this process (PubMed:25342469). Acts as a downstream effector of the interconnected PI3K and MAPK signaling pathways and thus participates in the regulation of the cell cycle (PubMed:28655764)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}